# Input

```scss
.sidebar>/* keep at the partial boundary */{.error{color:red}}
.toolbar/* keep before the partial combinator */>{.item{display:flex}}
.card{+{.media{display:block}}> .existing-leading-form{color:green}}
.navbar{&~{.container{width:100%}}}

```


# Formatted

```scss
.sidebar > /* keep at the partial boundary */ {
	.error {
		color: red;
	}
}
.toolbar /* keep before the partial combinator */ > {
	.item {
		display: flex;
	}
}
.card {
	+ {
		.media {
			display: block;
		}
	}
	> .existing-leading-form {
		color: green;
	}
}
.navbar {
	& ~ {
		.container {
			width: 100%;
		}
	}
}

```
